      "arabic": "١١٢٧٦- سائبة «١»\n، مولاة رسول اللَّه ﷺ. روت عن النبي ﷺ في اللقطة. روى عنها طارق بن عبد الرحمن في تاريخ النساء، كذا في الذيل لأبي موسى.",
      "english": "11276—Sa'ibah [1],\na female client of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him. She narrated from the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, concerning found property. Tariq ibn Abd al-Rahman narrated from her in Tarikh al-Nisa. Thus it appears in al-Dhayl by Abu Musa.",
